		"actions": {},
		"description": "<p>Your brilliance is undeniable and widely known. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Intelligence increases by +1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You immediately learn the schematic for a Rare magic item of your choice.</p></li><li><p>Your Savant levels count as Artificer levels for the purpose of gaining access to the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.pckq0dgz9f1i3ic8]{Advanced Tactical Chemistry} feature.</p></li><li><p>Your Artificer levels count as Savant levels for the purpose of gaining access to the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.x6lhfpalcln2p2jr]{Clockwork Mind} feature.</p></li><li><p>Treat your prestige score as 1 higher than it is (or 5, whichever is greater) when dealing with those who appreciate intelligence, inventiveness, or problem-solving.</p></li></ul>",
